    <item>
      <title>Version 1.5.0</title>
      <sparkle:version>150</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.5.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <pubDate>Fri, 17 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <h3>Clipboard history is now encrypted at rest</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Every clipboard item is stored using AES-GCM encryption with a 256-bit key kept in your macOS Keychain.</li>
          <li>Password managers that set the <code>ConcealedType</code> flag (1Password, Bitwarden, etc.) are now respected — those pastes are never recorded.</li>
          <li>Existing clipboard history is migrated automatically on first launch. No action needed.</li>
          <li>Automatic update checking is now enabled by default.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
